{"id":"nvme-wdc-capabilities.1","n":"nvme-wdc-capabilities","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"nvme-cli","ver":"2.11-7.el9_6","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/n/nvme-cli-2.11-7.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/nvme-wdc-capabilities.1.gz","sha256":"71fe6ccbf043abacd93f174504a22ab0ddc790e77ce9a36c82f3f84a3f5aa6df","date":"10/14/2025","origin":"NVMe"},"u":{"pkg":"nvme-cli","ver":"1.16-3ubuntu0.3","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/n/nvme-cli/nvme-cli_1.16-3ubuntu0.3_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/nvme-wdc-capabilities.1.gz","sha256":"dcf48dfd7b6ac0ec2718aa28ab18401c31be99cf7c144791f8fccb89f72860a2","date":"11/11/2021","origin":"NVMe"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"Display WDC plugin command capabilities","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>nvme-wdc-capabilities - Display WDC plugin command capabilities</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<pre><i>nvme wdc capabilities</i> &lt;device&gt;</pre>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>For the NVMe device given, displays list of commands and support status.</p> <p>The &lt;device&gt; parameter is mandatory NVMe character device (ex: /dev/nvme0).</p> <p>On success it returns 0, error code otherwise.</p>"],["EXAMPLES","<div class=\"in\">•Displays the capabilities for the device:  <div class=\"in\"> <pre># nvme wdc capabilities /dev/nvme0</pre> </div> </div>"],["NVME","<p>Part of the nvme-user suite.</p>"]]}